        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731000/extras/2fae04d03666de676a63bd1415d4e2ef.avif?t=1766642675\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skulker is a casual fishing game that combines elements of fishing exploration and prop collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a player, you will take on the role of an intergalactic hunter &quot;skulker&quot; who doesn't want to work, but only wants to fish, enjoying a comfortable fishing time on an alien planet, meeting various alien civilization characters, and learning about their preferences and stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players can match the rich fishing equipment, combining different genres of equipment matching effects in order to facilitate the decision-making of the current need to explore the attributes. Eventually, you can smoothly collect the rich fishing objects on the planet and fulfill the commission requests sent to you by different characters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2687</strong> of rich collection elements to satisfy the player's pure desire to collect and make time pass quickly without realizing it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731000/extras/de9cca7c4491d87d49a4c4cea5974466.poster.avif?t=1766642675\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731000/extras/de9cca7c4491d87d49a4c4cea5974466.webm?t=1766642675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731000/extras/de9cca7c4491d87d49a4c4cea5974466.mp4?t=1766642675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exploration experience in the form of dice rolls, where points are used to make decisions about fishing spots and trigger a variety of special events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731000/extras/a40ff829d6431ef6455d9cbdd75e849f.poster.avif?t=1766642675\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731000/extras/a40ff829d6431ef6455d9cbdd75e849f.webm?t=1766642675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731000/extras/a40ff829d6431ef6455d9cbdd75e849f.mp4?t=1766642675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of fishing techniques that operate differently, with each game distinctly different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731000/extras/6c2b8c00c1197df776735b9f5bdcf25c.poster.avif?t=1766642675\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731000/extras/6c2b8c00c1197df776735b9f5bdcf25c.webm?t=1766642675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731000/extras/6c2b8c00c1197df776735b9f5bdcf25c.mp4?t=1766642675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your own desktop aquarium, the size, location, fish selection, landscaping arrangement, are all up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731000/extras/5cee1c9f4e9144d1a74c5c39ead79625.poster.avif?t=1766642675\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731000/extras/5cee1c9f4e9144d1a74c5c39ead79625.webm?t=1766642675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731000/extras/5cee1c9f4e9144d1a74c5c39ead79625.mp4?t=1766642675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also mini-games with a variety of fun apps to pass the extra time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731000/extras/fa2f0182d5e9317c8ff7f654892253c7.poster.avif?t=1766642675\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731000/extras/fa2f0182d5e9317c8ff7f654892253c7.webm?t=1766642675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731000/extras/fa2f0182d5e9317c8ff7f654892253c7.mp4?t=1766642675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Final:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for a time-killing game to go to work and fish, Skulker will be your best choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are keen on fishing endlessly in all kinds of games, Skulker will meet your needs directly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're addicted to collecting, Skulker will also stop you in your tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you've read this far, you can go ahead and add Skulker to your <strong>Wishlist</strong> now.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the greatest support and recognition, thank you!</p></li></ul>",
